CHAPTER.VERS:
Say to them, [As] I live, saith the Lord GOD, 

          {{See Eze_18:23}}
         I have no pleasure in the death of the wicked; but that the wicked should turn from his way and live: turn ye, turn ye from your evil ways; for why will ye die, O house of Israel?

Again, when I say to the wicked, Thou shalt surely die; if he shall turn from his sin, and do that which is lawful and 

          By this he condemns them all of hypocrisy, who pretend to forsake wickedness and yet do not declare themselves such by their fruits, that is, in obeying God's commandments and by godly life.
         right;
